    {
      "modelVersion": "gemini-2.5-flash",
      "content": {
        "parts": [
          {
            "text": "Aquí tienes la consulta SQL para BigQuery que calcula la distribución estadística de la duración de los períodos de observación médica, estratificada por género:\n\n```sql\nSELECT\n    c.concept_name AS gender,\n    MIN(DATE_DIFF(op.observation_period_end_date, op.observation_period_start_date, DAY)) AS min_observation_days,\n    MAX(DATE_DIFF(op.observation_period_end_date, op.observation_period_start_date, DAY)) AS max_observation_days,\n    AVG(DATE_DIFF(op.observation_period_end_date, op.observation_period_start_date, DAY)) AS avg_observation_days,\n    STDDEV(DATE_DIFF(op.observation_period_end_date, op.observation_period_start_date, DAY)) AS stddev_observation_days,\n    COUNT(DISTINCT op.person_id) AS number_of_people\nFROM\n    `observation_period` AS op\nJOIN\n    `person` AS p\n    ON op.person_id = p.person_id\nJOIN\n    `concept` AS c\n    ON p.gender_concept_id = c.concept_id\nGROUP BY\n    c.concept_name\nORDER BY\n    c.concept_name\n```\n"
          }
        ],
