    {
      "modelVersion": "gemini-2.5-flash",
      "content": {
        "parts": [
          {
            "text": "Aquí tienes la consulta SQL revisada y mejorada para BigQuery, que incorpora los percentiles (25, 50, 75), ajusta el cálculo de la duración del período de observación (`DATE_DIFF + 1`) e incluye el filtro de calidad (`year_of_birth IS NOT NULL`).\n\nEsta versión utiliza una subconsulta para calcular la duración y luego aplica las funciones de agregación, incluyendo los percentiles, en la consulta externa.\n\n```sql\nSELECT\n    t.gender,\n    MIN(t.duration_days) AS min_observation_days,\n    MAX(t.duration_days) AS max_observation_days,\n    AVG(t.duration_days) AS avg_observation_days,\n    STDDEV(t.duration_days) AS stddev_observation_days,\n    PERCENTILE_CONT(t.duration_days, 0.25) OVER (PARTITION BY t.gender) AS percentile_25_observation_days,\n    PERCENTILE_CONT(t.duration_days, 0.50) OVER (PARTITION BY t.gender) AS median_observation_days,\n    PERCENTILE_CONT(t.duration_days, 0.75) OVER (PARTITION BY t.gender) AS percentile_75_observation_days,\n    COUNT(DISTINCT t.person_id) AS number_of_people\nFROM\n    (\n        SELECT\n            c.concept_name AS gender,\n            DATE_DIFF(op.observation_period_end_date, op.observation_period_start_date, DAY) + 1 AS duration_days,\n            p.person_id\n        FROM\n            `observation_period` AS op\n        JOIN\n            `person` AS p\n            ON op.person_id = p.person_id\n        JOIN\n            `concept` AS c\n            ON p.gender_concept_id = c.concept_id\n        WHERE\n            p.year_of_birth IS NOT NULL\n    ) AS t\nGROUP BY\n    t.gender\nORDER BY\n    t.gender\n```",
